        "title": "Seeing culture",
        "text": "We visited Pashupatinath Temple grounds after  doing Everest Base Camp. Entrance fee was 1000.00 pp and non-Hindu are banned to visit Pashupatunath Temple, but there was plenty to see on Pashupatinath grounds. We saw Nepalese funeral which took place across the river - members of family were burning the body - it was strange to see someone's legs sticking out and realising person's body is getting burned. Ashes were swept into river. In mean time kids were in the river looking for valuable items which were put together with body. Overall it was good to see the place. ",
